completed_at: "2026-10-26T18:37:43.901Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 90
acceptance_criteria: "Verify each exact adopted upstream timestamp is older than seven full days and each action SHA matches its official tag; Pass frozen-lock install and dependency/advisory, static, workflow-permission, typecheck, full exact coverage and supported consumer checks without weakening policies; Keep immature TruffleHog and the unaccepted Sentry major outside the adoption; close superseded bot PRs with canonical PM links after reviewed combined delivery"
parent: pm-wb25c1
risk: low
confidence: high
resolution: "Adopt mature Knip 6.42.1, TypeScript ESLint 8.72.0 and TruffleHog 3.99.3 with its official immutable action commit and explicit binary version. Retain CodeQL 4.39.0, CodSpeed 5.5.0, the latest changelog package SDK census, all security floors and every existing gate."
expected_result: "Every newly adopted package exceeds seven full days, tool peer and Node compatibility remain supported, scanner pins and workflow contracts agree, and no age, security, coverage or performance policy is weakened."
actual_result: "All twelve new lock entries have individual mature publication proof. Frozen installation, registry and independent-feed security, export analysis, lint, typecheck, 34 workflow/dependency cases and both linked recipes pass. Runtime source is unchanged from the passing 11,461-test exact-coverage run. Qualified local CLI transport failures also occur on immutable main and remain documented; fresh exact-head hosted admission is mandatory."
